    "description": {
      "value": "<p>White-hot embers fill a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in the Sphere makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 6d8 Fire damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p>Creatures, and flammable objects that aren’t worn or carried, in the Sphere start burning, taking 1d8 Fire damage at the start of each of their turns instead of the usual damage for burning.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 4.</p>",
